1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,935
The trial run began with an act of the council and a fund of real money.

2
00:00:03,935 --> 00:00:10,694
“The issue is not the answer, it is the order of the questions,” the mayor said.

3
00:00:10,694 --> 00:00:25,051
“We will assess one ward, then decide.” Security, welfare, and liability were all in the proclamation, and so was the obligatory payment of two pounds a month.

4
00:00:25,051 --> 00:00:32,430
The finding of the first week was a surprise: the appeal of the scheme was strongest among the poor.

5
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:37,304
“They are not chasing charity,” the social worker said.

6
00:00:37,304 --> 00:00:50,526
“They are buying certainty.” A complaint from an elite household, a pile of forms, and a monetary flaw in the tariff were the first three items on the list.

7
00:00:50,526 --> 00:00:56,495
The truth of the trial was that a small payment produced a large satisfaction.

8
00:00:56,495 --> 00:01:11,832
“The economy of a wallet is not the economy of a city,” the treasurer warned, “and a boom in small deposits can float a false confidence.” The point was written on the board in a chip of chalk.

9
00:01:11,832 --> 00:01:16,970
The discovery of the second week was the involvement of the retailers.

10
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:25,374
“Either the shop pays or the citizen does, whereas both of them already pay twice,” a shopkeeper said.

11
00:01:25,374 --> 00:01:32,352
The handicapped residents of the third ward were the group the scheme had missed entirely.

12
00:01:32,352 --> 00:01:38,201
The valid objection came from the defendant in a pending case about the water bill.

13
00:01:38,201 --> 00:01:43,860
“A competent administration does not need perfection,” she said.

14
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:52,768
“It needs a flaw it can admit.” The authorization for the second trial was signed the same afternoon.

15
00:01:52,768 --> 00:02:03,001
The containment of the cost, the answer to the liability question, and the announcement of the next stage were the three things the meeting produced.

16
00:02:03,001 --> 00:02:07,695
“There is no support in a proclamation,” Lin wrote.

17
00:02:07,695 --> 00:02:16,858
“There is support in a payment that arrives every month.” The point of the trial was simple, and it had to be shown.

18
00:02:16,858 --> 00:02:23,042
We had to pick between a force and an argument, and between a thing and a promise.

19
00:02:23,042 --> 00:02:30,496
“Introduce the payment, show the evidence, and let the meeting decide,” the mayor said.

20
00:02:30,496 --> 00:02:39,049
It was the same party and the same poor ward, either way, and someone within the world of city hall had to be wrong first.

21
00:02:39,049 --> 00:02:49,056
As an institution, the council was liable for the imposition of the fee, and a turkey dinner was not the answer.
